WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.707
Open the calculator.

2
00:00:01.827 --> 00:00:06.215
Open More resources, choose Tools, and select Position size.

3
00:00:06.335 --> 00:00:10.027
This is a Pro tool; the walkthrough uses a demonstration account.

4
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:12.302
Enter your inputs.

5
00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:20.468
Set a practice budget of one thousand dollars, a one percent risk limit, a one hundred dollar entry, and a ninety eight dollar stop.

6
00:00:21.506 --> 00:00:22.922
Read the share size.

7
00:00:23.042 --> 00:00:26.513
Read the resulting five-share estimate and expand the tool guide.

8
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:30.383
The size is a planning calculation and does not place a trade.

